menu "Face database"

    config FACEDB_MAX_RECORDS
        int "Templates the table holds in PSRAM"
        default 1000
        range 2 4000
        help
            One record is 576 bytes (KEHOACH 6.2.4), so the default of 1000
            records, about 333 people at three templates a capture, reserves
            576 KB of PSRAM once at init. A table that fills up compacts its
            soft-deleted records first and refuses the enrol only when that
            frees nothing.

endmenu
